turen-firmware-formats-wasm
Copyright (c) 2026 Turen Labs

This package contains Turen's bounded WebAssembly decoders for embedded and
firmware file formats: flattened device trees (Devicetree Specification),
legacy U-Boot images and environment blobs (DENX U-Boot), Intel HEX,
Motorola S-Record, and Android sparse images (AOSP libsparse format). All
parsers are original implementations written against the public format
specifications; no upstream application code is included.

Built from the following permissively licensed crates.io dependencies:

- serde_json 1.0.145 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JSON envelopes and serialization
- serde 1.0.x (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — serde_json data model
- wasm-bindgen 0.2.108 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — JavaScript bindings

Notable transitive crates: itoa, memchr, ryu, serde_core (MIT OR
Apache-2.0). The full dependency closure is recorded in Cargo.lock; every
entry is permissively licensed. No GPL, LGPL, or proprietary code is linked
into the module.
